mfm.build.$1 - Allows to build defined entity
mfm.bypasslimit.$1 - Allows to bypass block or entity limitations
mfm.cleaninform - Informs player about cleanup results
mfm.command.$1 - Gives access to command
mfm.command.clean - Grants access to the clean command; Default: op
mfm.command.limits.full - Shows full information for limits around you
mfm.command.reload - Grants access to the clean command; Default: op
mfm.permisiononerror - Allows to see missing permission on error message
